&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The protagonist, Mao Shinguji, is an apprentice exorcist monk whose profession is hunting demons. During the day, he lives a normal student life, but at the rest of the time, he devotes himself to his training at the temple where he lives. One night, Mao senses an unusual &amp;ldquo;demonic energy&amp;rdquo; in town and rushes to the scene, where he finds a seductive girl standing there completely naked. Her name is Luara, the &amp;ldquo;Princess of the Demon World Tree.&amp;rdquo; She has come to the human world incognito to broaden her knowledge as the successor to support the demon world.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Datsui Mahjong Battle Royale 48</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/7691/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Oct 2012 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/7691/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
